Package: bcwsft
Title: BC Wildfire Service Fuel Typing Algorithm (R Port)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gregory A.", "Greene", email = "map.n.trowel@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of the original Python implementation (bcwft2018)"),
    person("Alex M.", "Chubaty", email = "achubaty@for-cast.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "R port"))
Description: An R port of the British Columbia Wildfire Service fuel-typing
    algorithm, which assigns Canadian Forest Fire Behaviour Prediction (FBP)
    System fuel types to Vegetation Resources Inventory (VRI) polygons using the
    expert decision tree of Perrakis, Eade and Hicks (2018). This package is a
    faithful translation of Gregory A. Greene's Python implementation
    ('bcwft2018', <https://github.com/gagreene/BC_CFFBPS_FuelTyping_Tool>), with
    no ArcGIS / arcpy dependency, intended as an independent cross-check on
    map-derived fuel-type products.
